  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>A Sigil Crystal focuses the energy of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> blade with incredible efficiency, causing it to have a more devastating effect on a target. When you wield an attuned <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> with a Sigil Crystal, you gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on damage rolls made with that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>. </p>",
